<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:add28e00-89a6-45a7-91ec-b997291c0da6">
              <SHORT-NAME>NvM</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the NvM (NvRam Manager) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvM（Non-volatile Memory Manager），负责管理非易失性存储器的读写操作，确保数据的持久性和一致性。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置NvM时，需要确保正确设置存储块的大小和冗余策略，以防数据丢失；NvM配置应与ECU的硬件存储能力相匹配，避免性能瓶颈；</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00539</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:592eb68c-8ec5-46e2-aa34-9d55999b105e">
                  <SHORT-NAME>NvMCommonVendorParams</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Container for a management structure to configure the composition of a given NVRAM Block Management Type. Its multiplicity describes the number of configured NVRAM blocks, one block is required to be configured. The NVRAM block descriptors are condensed in the NVRAM block descriptor table.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMCommonVendorParams 是一个配置容器，用于定义非易失性内存管理（NvM）模块的供应商特定参数，这些参数通常与硬件或底层存储设备的特性有关。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置NvMCommonVendorParams时，需要确保所选参数与底层存储硬件兼容；此外，在进行系统集成时，应当验证这些参数的设置是否对系统性能和可靠性产生了预期的影响。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:614a2811-2efd-41e7-9109-fb467f80adf2">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMCfgCbkIncludeList</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter describes the SectionInitializationPolicys for which a particular RTE initialization strategy applies.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMCfgCbkIncludeList配置项用于指定NvM模块在编译时需要包含的回调函数列表，确保在NvM操作过程中能够调用到用户定义的特定回调函数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：用户需要确保列表中的回调函数与实际实现相匹配，避免因找不到函数实现而导致编译错误；</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">NvMCfgCbkIncludeList</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09088</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES/>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS/>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:592eb68c-8ec5-46e2-aa34-9d55999b105e">
                  <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockDescriptor</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Container for a management structure to configure the composition of a given NVRAM Block Management Type. Its multiplicity describes the number of configured NVRAM blocks, one block is required to be configured. The NVRAM block descriptors are condensed in the NVRAM block descriptor table.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockDescriptor 是一个配置项，用于描述非易失性内存（NVM）模块中的一个数据块，包括其属性、管理策略和存储目标。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置NvMBlockDescriptor时，必须确保数据块的标识符（block_id）在整个系统中是唯一的；数据块的大小和存储结构应与实际的内存布局相匹配；对于需要冗余存储或ROM默认数据的数据块，还需配置相应的冗余策略和ROM数据属性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00061</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65536</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0ff44e7b-65ca-4948-867e-d57ef3ef1902">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockUseAutoValidation</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether the RAM Block shall be auto validated during shutdown phase.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockUseAutoValidation配置项用于指定非易失性内存（NVM）块在读取操作后是否自动执行数据有效性验证，以确保数据的完整性和准确性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置项对于确保数据一致性和错误处理机制至关重要；配置时需考虑系统的性能要求和错误恢复策略；不适当的使用可能导致性能下降或数据不一致问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: if auto validation mechanism is used,
                                        false: otherwise</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00557</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8a736e46-360a-438b-9066-a9a52092e5eb">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockUseCrc</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines CRC usage for the NVRAM block, i.e. memory space for CRC is reserved in RAM and NV memory.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockUseCrc配置项用于指定是否对非易失性内存（NVM）块进行CRC（循环冗余校验）检查，以确保数据的完整性和正确性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在启用CRC校验时，需要注意CRC计算和校验的性能开销，特别是在数据块较大时；选择合适的CRC算法以满足系统的可靠性要求；实现时需确保与底层存储介质的兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:     	CRC will be used for this NVRAM block.
                                        false:     	CRC will not be used for this NVRAM block.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00036</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8a73c546-362a-438b-9606-a9a52e5eb209">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMAutoBlockLength</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines the NvMBlocklength can be calculated by the generator automatically.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMAutoBlockLength配置项用于自动计算并设置非易失性内存（NVM）块的长度，简化了内存管理的配置过程。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用NvMAutoBlockLength时，必须确保所有相关的数据类型大小已正确定义，以便自动计算能准确进行；该特性可能不适用于所有项目，特别是那些对内存布局有特殊要求的项目；对NvMAutoBlockLength的支持可能因具体的NVM管理模块实现而异，需要参考具体供应商的实现文档。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:     	NvMBlocklength will not be considered during ECU Configuration but will be (re-)calculated by the code generator.
                                        false:     	NvMBlocklength will be considered during ECU Configuration.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00036</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6f8a842b-59e5-4acc-9617-231f69fdc50c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockUseCRCCompMechanism</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether the CRC of the RAM Block shall be compared during a write job with the CRC which was calculated during the last successful read or write job.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockUseCRCCompMechanism配置项用于指定非易失性内存（NVM）块是否使用CRC（循环冗余校验）比较机制，以确保数据的完整性和一致性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：使用CRC机制可以提高数据可靠性，但可能会增加数据读写的时间开销；选择合适的CRC算法对性能和安全性有重要影响；在配置时需确保与系统的容错需求和性能预算相匹配。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: if compare mechanism is used,
                                        false: otherwise</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00556</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fa2af381-8213-4500-a6de-9e8722792550">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockUseSetRamBlockStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines if NvMSetRamBlockStatusApi shall be used for this block or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockUseSetRamBlockStatus配置项用于指定是否为非易失性内存（NVM）块启用SetRamBlockStatus API，该API允许动态更改NVM块的RAM块状态。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置时，需要确保NVM管理器已正确配置以支持RAM块状态管理；此功能可能会增加RAM的使用量，因为每个启用了该功能的NVM块都需要额外的RAM空间来维护状态；此配置项的使用应与系统的内存管理策略和性能要求相匹配。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Note: If NvMSetRamBlockStatusApi is disabled this configuration parameter shall be ignored.

                                        true: calling of NvMSetRamBlockStatus for this RAM block shall set the status of the RAM block.

                                        false: calling of NvMSetRamBlockStatus for this RAM block shall be ignored.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00552</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:17667a35-d32a-4544-85dc-32bd1dc2663f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockUseSyncMechanism</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether an explicit synchronization mechanism with a RAM mirror and callback routines for transferring data to and from NvM module's RAM mirror is used for NV block. true if synchronization mechanism is used, false otherwise.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockUseSyncMechanism 是一个配置参数，用于指定非易失性内存（NVM）块的数据读取和写入操作是否应该同步执行，即在调用API返回之前完成。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在选择同步机制时，需要确保系统的实时性要求得以满足，因为同步操作可能会导致调用线程阻塞；此外，对于需要频繁访问的NVM块，过度使用同步机制可能会影响系统性能；此外，应当检查该配置项是否与系统设计和NVM驱动的实现相兼容。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00519</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:583499ba-6121-4c40-88ee-ef45f8ccc250">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockWriteProt</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines an initial write protection of the NV block</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockWriteProt是一个配置参数，用于设置非易失性内存（NVM）块的写保护属性，以防止数据被意外或未授权地修改。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保NvMBlockWriteProt的设置与系统安全需求相符合；写保护配置应在系统设计阶段确定，并在整个系统生命周期中保持一致；不正确的写保护设置可能导致数据完整性问题或阻止必要的数据更新。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:	Initial block write protection is enabled.
                                        false:	Initial block write protection is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:eccb246d-a8a5-41a2-a478-f85dc807d31b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBswMBlockStatusInformation</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies whether BswM is informed about the current status of the specified block.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBswMBlockStatusInformation配置项用于定义非易失性内存（NvM）块的状态信息，以便由BSW Mode Manager (BswM) 管理和监控，确保数据的一致性和完整性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保NvMBswMBlockStatusInformation的配置与BswM模块的要求相匹配；正确配置NvM块状态信息，以便BswM能够有效地管理这些状态；在系统设计时要考虑NvM块状态对系统行为的影响，特别是在故障恢复和数据一致性方面。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">True: Call BswM_NvM_CurrentBlockMode on changes
                                        False: Don't inform BswM at all</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00551</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7a30fc79-9a8f-482f-ad77-0bbdaa443670">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMCalcRamBlockCrc</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines CRC (re)calculation for the permanent RAM block or NVRAM blocks which are configured to use explicit synchronization mechanism.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMCalcRamBlockCrc 配置项用于指定是否在每次读取或写入非易失性内存（NVM）块之前和之后计算RAM块的CRC校验和，以确保数据的完整性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：CRC校验是数据一致性和错误检测的重要机制；配置时需考虑系统性能和数据安全性之间的平衡；CRC计算可能会增加RAM块处理的时间开销，特别是对于大型数据块。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:	CRC will be (re)calculated for this permanent RAM block.
                                        false: 	CRC will not be (re)calculated for this permanent RAM block.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00119</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b94632c6-fe1d-4b6f-9ba2-f39c2a5689f8">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMResistantToChangedSw</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether a NVRAM block shall be treated resistant to configuration changes or not. If there is no default data available at configuration time then the application shall be responsible for providing the default initialization data. In this case the application has to use nvm_get_error_status()to be able to distinguish between first initialization and corrupted data.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMResistantToChangedSw 是一个配置参数，用于指示非易失性内存管理（NvM）模块的数据是否应该在软件版本更改后保持不变。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置时，确保理解其对数据完整性和软件升级的影响；此配置项对于确保在软件更新后数据的一致性和可靠性至关重要；此配置项应当谨慎处理，以避免数据丢失或不一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: 	NVRAM block is resistant to changed software.
                                        false: 	NVRAM block is not resistant to changed software.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00483</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9c7e8e06-799b-4367-9a71-88518356a776">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMSelectBlockForFirstInitAll</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether a block will be processed or not by NvM_FirstInitAll. A block can be configured to be processed even if it doesn't have permanent RAM and/or explicit synchronization.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMSelectBlockForFirstInitAll 配置项用于指定在执行 NvM_InitAll 函数时，哪些非易失性内存（NVM）块应该被选中进行首次初始化。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保只有那些需要在首次启动时初始化的NVM块被选中；不应该选择那些包含默认数据或不需要初始化的块；此配置项的使用应符合项目的内存初始化策略和要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: block will be processed by NvM_FirstInitAll

                                        FALSE: block will not be processed by NvM_FirstInitAll</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00558</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:863190d4-9883-4087-87c3-d2d52d03a810">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMSelectBlockForReadAll</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether a NVRAM block shall be processed during nvm_read_all or not. This configuration parameter has only influence on those NVRAM blocks which are configured to have a permanent RAM block or which are configured to use explicit synchronization mechanism.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMSelectBlockForReadAll配置项用于在NVM（非易失性内存管理）模块中选择特定的数据块进行全读操作，这使得在系统启动或特定条件下可以批量读取配置或状态数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保所选数据块已在NVM中定义且适用于ReadAll操作；ReadAll操作可能会影响系统启动时间，因此应谨慎选择必要的数据块；该配置项应与NvMBlockDescriptor配置项一致，以确保数据块的正确识别和访问。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true:	NVRAM block shall be processed by nvm_read_all
                                        false:	NVRAM block shall not be processed by nvm_read_all</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00117</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:54fd91d0-941a-4b67-9cc6-3d54449cf164">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMSelectBlockForWriteAll</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether a NVRAM block shall be processed during nvm_write_all or not. This configuration parameter has only influence on those NVRAM blocks which are configured to have a permanent RAM block or which are configured to use explicit synchronization mechanism.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMSelectBlockForWriteAll 配置项用于指定在执行 nvm_write_all 操作时，哪些非易失性内存（NVM）块应被选中以进行写入操作。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保只有需要在 WriteAll 操作中被写入的 NVM 块被选中；不应选择那些仅在单独请求时才需要写入的块；此配置项对系统的备份策略和恢复机制有重要影响，因此需要谨慎配置以避免不必要的数据损失或性能问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: NVRAM block shall be processed by nvm_write_all
                                        false: NVRAM block shall not be processed by nvm_write_all</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00549</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1a7d96ce-bcbe-4b69-8322-f18851048bdd">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMStaticBlockIDCheck</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines if the Static Block ID check is enabled.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMStaticBlockIDCheck是一个配置参数，用于在非易失性内存管理（NvM）模块中启用或禁用静态块ID检查，以确保数据块的一致性和正确性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：必须确保NvM配置的BlockID与系统中定义的BlockID一致，以防止数据损坏；如果启用了静态BlockID检查，系统将在运行时验证BlockID，这可能会增加额外的开销；在生产环境中，通常建议启用此功能以提高系统的健壮性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">false: Static Block ID check is disabled.
                                        true: Static Block ID check is enabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00532</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:95a53ff9-d845-4bc8-9b07-cfe70a131869">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMWriteBlockOnce</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines write protection after first write. The NVRAM manager sets the write protection bit either after the NV block was written the first time or if the block was already written and it is detected as valid and consistent during a read for it. [NVM276].</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMWriteBlockOnce 是一个配置项，用于指定非易失性内存（NVM）中的数据块是否应该只被写入一次，通常用于确保数据的一致性和防止重复写入。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用NvMWriteBlockOnce时，确保数据块的重要性和一次性写入需求明确；此配置项可能与数据块的重写策略冲突，需谨慎配置；应检查与其他NvM管理策略的兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Defines write protection after first write is enabled.

                                        false: Defines write protection after first write is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00072</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:536e74a6-5a54-441f-8a7e-3a59ca814898">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMWriteVerification</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines if Write Verification is enabled.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMWriteVerification 是一个配置参数，用于指定非易失性内存管理（NvM）模块在写入数据到非易失性存储器后是否执行验证步骤，以确保数据的正确性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：必须确保NvMWriteVerification配置与系统的可靠性和性能要求相匹配；开启写入验证会增加数据持久化的时间，可能影响系统性能；关闭写入验证可能降低数据一致性保证，但可以提高系统的响应速度。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">false: Write verification is disabled.
                                        true: Write Verification is enabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00534</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b7447ae4-f639-4432-9efb-cd26e048e87f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NvMBlockCrcType</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines CRC data width for the NVRAM block. Default: NVM_CRC16, i.e. CRC16 will be used  if NVM_BLOCK_USE_CRC==true</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvMBlockCrcType 是一个配置参数，用于指定非易失性内存（NVM）块的CRC（循环冗余校验）类型，以确保数据的完整性和一致性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在选择CRC类型时，需要考虑系统对数据完整性的要求和性能的平衡；不同的CRC类型可能会对系统性能和校验效率产生不同的影响；应确保所选的CRC类型与标准支持的类型一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00476</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
