                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:53c6dcf1-a51c-404e-9986-89750b749edb">
                  <SHORT-NAME>NvmDemEventParameterRefs</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Container for the references to DemEventParameter elements which shall be invoked using the API Dem_SetEventStatus in case the corresponding error occurs. The EventId is taken from the referenced DemEventParameter's DemEventId symbolic value. The standardized errors are provided in this container and can be extended by vendor-specific error references.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NvmDemEventParameterRefs配置项用于将非易失性存储器(NVM)管理的配置参数与诊断事件管理器(DEM)中定义的事件参数关联起来，以便在发生特定诊断事件时触发NVM操作。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的DEM事件参数在DEM配置中已定义且有效；此配置项对于实现基于事件的NVM数据存储和恢复机制至关重要；对NvmDemEventParameterRefs的使用应遵循模块间通信和数据一致性的要求。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00541</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:24a2ee3b-2bc5-42a7-af5f-dc76873d64f4">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NVM_E_HARDWARE</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the DemEventParameter which shall be issued when the hardware error has occured.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NVM_E_HARDWARE 是一个错误状态码，用于表示非易失性存储器（NVM）管理器在尝试访问底层硬件时遇到了硬件错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：当底层存储硬件（如EEPROM或Flash）发生物理故障时，应报告此错误；该错误码通常与诊断事件、DEM（Diagnostic Event Manager）集成或错误处理策略相关联；在实现时，应确保硬件抽象层（HAL）能够正确识别并向NVM管理器报告硬件故障。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00553</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
