                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemEventParameter</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7ab1f486-d96b-41ca-bf55-ada6c06abd6d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NVM_E_INTEGRITY_FAILED</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the DemEventParameter which shall be issued when the error &quot;API request integrity failed&quot; has occurred.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NVM_E_INTEGRITY_FAILED 是一个错误状态码，用于指示非易失性存储（NVM）管理器在校验数据完整性时检测到数据损坏或不一致。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用NVM管理器时，应确保数据的校验机制正确实现，以便能够检测到潜在的数据完整性问题；如果返回此错误码，需要有相应的错误处理策略来恢复或重新初始化受影响的数据；确保错误处理逻辑与系统的容错需求一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00542</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
