                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemConfigSet/DemEventParameter</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:83187ce0-6e2e-4905-94d0-8e924685ce3b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>NVM_E_WRITE_PROTECTED</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the DemEventParameter which shall be issued when the error &quot;write attempt to NVRAM block with write protection&quot; has occurred.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：NVM_E_WRITE_PROTECTED 是一个错误状态码，用于指示请求写入非易失性存储器（NVM）时，目标区域被写保护，导致写入操作无法执行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在处理NVM请求时，应检查存储区域的写保护状态；如果存储区域被意外地设置为写保护，可能需要重新配置或解除保护；在设计NVM管理策略时，应确保正确处理此类错误码，以便于系统稳定性和数据完整性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_NvM_00548</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
